<title>USA: Venturian president Desmont leaves firm.</title>
<headline>Venturian president Desmont leaves firm.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Venturian Corp said on Friday its president, Thomas Desmond, has left the company.</p>
<p>It said chairman and former president Gary Rappaport would return to his role as president, effective immediately.</p>
<p>No further details were available.</p>
<p>Venturian's subsidiary, Napco International Inc, manufactures and supplies a variety of defense-related products to governments and commercial customers worldwide. It also has a software subsidiary that distributes an Internet computer telephony product.</p>
<p>((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
